From cf79c34fa8b276ad868ec70172454dceb43e7839 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:19:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add CopyToClipboardButton component

The button copies the value of a field of the current record to the
clipboard and notifies the user of the result. It reads the record from
its props (as injected by Datagrid and SimpleShowLayout), and falls back
to the RecordContext so that it also works in the Show actions.

When the async Clipboard API isn't available (non secure contexts), it
falls back to document.execCommand('copy'). The button is disabled when
the field is empty, and isn't sortable when used as a Datagrid column.

Add the ra.action.copy, ra.notification.copied_to_clipboard and
ra.notification.copy_to_clipboard_error messages to the English and
French translations.
